202
00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:28.390
So I've always really loved finding ways to do things.

203
00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:34.030
I love finding systems for things and making things kind of efficient, but I had not yet

204
00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.130
