205
00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:40.010
And so I really started out just being a natural, trying to be a genius at everything.

206
00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.190
And what that meant was that I didn't try anything new.

207
00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.450
