I had a, y'all, I had a calendar on my fridge that was a year.

214
00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:13.470
It was a full annual January to December.

215
00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:21.490
And I made a cleaning schedule for an entire year on a year that I had a baby.

216
00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.930
What on, or that is, that is genius energy going in the wrong direction.

