And then I was also kind of sad because like, I care about things.

224
00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.050
I want to do good work and things.

225
00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:50.050
I want to like put time and energy into stuff that matters to me, but I didn't have the language

226
00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.110
for that difference yet.

227
00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:56.710
So I was just, I was just like swinging like this real caffeinated pendulum of like genius,

228
00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:57.830
lazy, genius, lazy.

229
00:11:57.990 --> 00:11:59.170
It was really intense.

230
00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:05.190
And then I had a third kid and I guess I have like these big life realizations when I'm

231
00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.450
children and thought there's got to be a better way.

232
00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.530
Like I don't have to keep going to these extremes.

233
00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:14.790
What if I was a genius about the things that I care about, but I could let the other stuff

234
00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:15.210
go.

235
00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:21.010
And I was doing some work on the internet already, just in a different category and, and just

236
00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:26.430
pivoted the business to this where I started to talk about this because this was such a

237
