common problem among women, especially because we're told to care.

238
00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:36.070
We, you, you do it all, you have it all, you be it all, you know?

239
00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:42.650
And we can't, we, we literally can't, but the, the alternative is not to just give up.

240
